	)
	(text "One four-layer main board in a Hammond 125B on the Alchemist / Relic grid; pots, toggles, LEDs and jacks board-mounted.\nSignal: IN -> K401 relay bypass -> 1M / 100n -> OPA2365 buffer -> THS4522 ADC driver -> AK4621 ADC -> STM32H750VBT6 (SAI1) -> AK4621 DAC -> OPA1688 difference amps -> OUT L (through K401) and OUT R.\nDesign notes: docs/design-brief.md, docs/pcb-plan.md. The schematic is written by scripts/harp_schematic/build_layout.py from harp_spec.py and the layouts in layouts/; after the first edit in KiCad the KiCad files are the source of truth."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Oswald")
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c6c11629-8cf7-4a7a-ab9a-d90385558d7c")
	)
